1
00:00:00,819 --> 00:00:02,021
As Uke strikes

2
00:00:02,022 --> 00:00:04,671
lead the strike around 
in a big circular movement

3
00:00:04,972 --> 00:00:08,449
as you cut down 
control the back of Uke´s elbow

4
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:12,098
step in deeply behind him 
controlling the back of the neck,

5
00:00:12,099 --> 00:00:12,863
cut down

6
00:00:13,464 --> 00:00:15,786
as Uke gets up to regain his balance

7
00:00:15,787 --> 00:00:17,356
draw him back into your shoulder

8
00:00:17,757 --> 00:00:21,044
turn, step in deeply behind him 
and throw down.

